                <div class="my-1.5">
                    This endpoint allows you to retrieve detailed information about a specific Formula One season.
                    You can get data on the races, results, drivers, constructors, and other key details relevant to
                    that season.
                </div>
                <div class="w-full flex p-2 bg-gray-700">
                    <div class="flex items-center text-green-400 ">
                        GET
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-1 flex items-center px-4 text-white">
                        https://formulaone.prb-dev.fr/api/seasons/{year}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
